OL,3,GNEWSARhun ap Iorwerth to face Senedd
OL,4,Aafter declaring 'Westminster's coming
OL,5,Ato an end'
OL,6,
OL,7,FRhun ap Iorwerth is set to be grilled
OL,8,Fby opposition parties in the Senedd for
OL,9,FFirst Minister's Questions
OL,11,FIt comes a day after he joined fellow
OL,12,Fpro-independence first ministers of
OL,13,FScotland and Northern Ireland to
OL,14,Fdeclare that the UK government's time
OL,15,F"is coming to an end", and agree to
OL,16,Fhelp each other with constitutional
OL,17,Freforms
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
